  "description_html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"courseDescription\">\n    Prerequisite: A grade of C or better in CHEM 2134 or equivalent, or approval of the instructor.\n\nCo-requisite: CHEM 3250. \n\nAn introduction to the chemistry of covalently bonded carbon. Special emphasis will be given to descriptive and structural aspects of Organic Chemistry. \n\nLecture three hours, laboratory three hours.\n    \n</section>",
